# Vael wakes up captive in the Cathedral (Milestone 20a, escape start).
# Plays once, the first time the Cathedral loads on Vael's game.

wait 0.6
emote player ...
narrate Cold stone. Candle smoke, and something rotten underneath it.
face player left
wait 0.4
face player right
wait 0.4
face player down
say Vael: The Cathedral... but it's wrong. The light in here has gone dark.
say Vael: They didn't even chain me. Whoever put me here never expected me to wake.
narrate Somewhere deeper in the halls, a voice is calling for help.
